# Live web deploy after adjustments

When the user asks for UI/feature adjustments and needs to test on another browser:

1. Implement the change in the codebase.
2. Before ending the turn, deploy to Cloudflare Pages so the live site updates:
   - Run from project root:
     `cmd /c "set MAYABELA_NOPAUSE=1&& deploy-cloudflare-pages.cmd"`
   - Or equivalent: build web release, then `npx wrangler@4 pages deploy build/web --project-name=mayabela --commit-dirty=true`
3. Tell the user the live URL: **https://mayabela.pages.dev**
4. Remind them to hard-refresh (**Ctrl+Shift+R**) if they still see the old UI.

Do this whenever web/UI/platform-console changes are made in the session unless the user explicitly says not to deploy (e.g. local-only debug).
